+// gin-restore (rs, work packages 3 and 4; EXPERIMENT.md 9.5, 9.6, 9.9, 9.11.5): the side table of one GDAKI context, in
+// device memory, zeroed at creation. Only a process that asks for the restore has one; elsewhere
